endarios", "National Pokédex": "pos-game", "N''s Castle": "pos-game", "Alder": "pos-game", "White Treehollow": "pos-game", "Haxorus shiny": "pos-game", "Pokémon World Tournament": "pos-game", "Revanche da Liga": "pos-game"}'::jsonb)
